From pearl-miui-camera-6.6-compat
Subject: [PATCH] Show loading animation until the portrait thumbnail is ready

The save pipeline sends a preview thumbnail while mWaitingForUri is true,
then sends the final thumbnail after the MediaStore uri is available. Do not
refresh the bottom thumbnail for the preview callback: show a spinner until
the final callback arrives. This also prevents the normal capture flow from
refreshing the thumbnail twice.

